    "feature-match-feel": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_f1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Train Like You're Already at the Table",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "alignment": "left",
            "mobile_alignment": "mobile-left",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 15
          }
        },
        "text_f1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Generic curls and wrist rollers build muscle, sure — but they don't build <em>arm wrestling muscle</em>. The pulling angle, the tension curve, the way your forearm fires through the movement — it's completely different at the table.</p><p>This trainer's hydraulic resistance system is engineered to replicate that exact force curve. Every rep activates your forearms, wrists, and biceps the same way a real match would — so your strength transfers directly to performance.</p>",
            "alignment": "left",
            "mobile_alignment": "mobile-left",
            "text_size": 14,
            "enable_custom_color": false,
            "custom_text_color": "#ff0000",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 15
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
