    "feature-muscle-targeting": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_f2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Hit the Muscles That Actually Win",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "alignment": "left",
            "mobile_alignment": "mobile-left",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 15
          }
        },
        "text_f2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Arm wrestling isn't just biceps. It's a full-arm chain: your forearm fires first, your biceps lock the angle, and your shoulder group stabilizes the whole thing. Miss any one of these and you'll lose to someone half your size.</p><p>This trainer is engineered to load all three, in the movement pattern that matters most.</p><p><strong>Targets:</strong> Forearm Muscles · Biceps Brachii · Shoulder Group · Grip Strength · Wrist Flexion · Pull Endurance</p>",
            "alignment": "left",
            "mobile_alignment": "mobile-left",
            "text_size": 14,
            "enable_custom_color": false,
            "custom_text_color": "#ff0000",
            "margin_top": 0,
