    "feature-beechwood-build": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_f3": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Premium Beechwood — No Cheap Substitutes",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "alignment": "left",
            "mobile_alignment": "mobile-left",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 15
          }
        },
        "text_f3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We chose Eastern European beechwood deliberately. It's dense, it absorbs vibration, it feels warm and solid in the hand — and it won't crack, flex, or creak under heavy resistance like the plastic-bodied trainers you'll find on generic marketplace listings.</p><ul><li>Solid beechwood frame — no wobble, no flex under load</li><li>Non-slip grip handle — stays secure even when your palms sweat</li><li>Stable base — no suction cups, no mounting, no setup needed</li><li>Reinforced with stainless steel rods throughout</li></ul>",
            "alignment": "left",
            "mobile_alignment": "mobile-left",
            "text_size": 14,
            "enable_custom_color": false,
            "custom_text_color": "#ff0000",
            "margin_top": 0,
