        },
        "text_f4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Finding a training partner at the right skill level, available when you are, who won't disappear after two sessions — that's the real challenge in arm wrestling training. This trainer removes that dependency entirely.</p><p>Set it on any flat surface. Adjust the resistance. Pull. That's it. You get targeted, consistent reps on your own schedule — whether it's 6am before work or 11pm after the gym.</p><ul><li>Ready in seconds — zero setup or assembly</li><li>Works on desks, tables, workbenches, kitchen counters</li><li>Compact enough for truck cabs, hotel rooms, office breaks</li></ul>",
