            "text": "<p><strong>Simple, effective, no gimmicks</strong></p><p>Bought this to add focused forearm work at home, and it's been worth every penny. The wood frame feels sturdy and not cheap at all. I like that it keeps the training focused — it's not trying to be 10 things at once. For a dedicated arm trainer for home use, this is the one.</p><p><em>✓ Verified Purchase</em></p>",
